  "description": "The MITTE Steel v3 Urban offers you numerous possibilities to be perfectly equipped for the next ride, whether for everyday city traffic on your way to work or a leisure ride on the weekend! You spend several hours on your bike every week and therefore you need a reliable and robust bike that is also comfortable and easy to maintain. Commuting is your time off. We want this time to be recharging and the least stressful. Choose your features: fenders to protect you from dirt, internally geared to give you extra comfort, racks to carry your heavy bags and integrated lights to show you the way in the dark.\n\nCarbon 2in1 Fork has only limited compatible with fenders and racks.\n\nThe MITTE STEEL 2022 will come with Thru Axle, 142mm rear frame spacing and Flatmount!**\n\n1 1/8 – 1 1/2 head tube\n\nIntegrated seat clamp\n\nTire clearance up to 700x50 / 650x2.1\n\nChain stay 425–440mm\n\n12x142mm rear axle",
